 SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView":{"title":"Interaction_PinchView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a rounded triangle. A magnification (pinch) gesture feeds the shape’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"), gated by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" paging; releasing settles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the nearest state with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at its base scale,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centered on the magenta artboard."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}